{"t":"Ice Strike","s":"ice-strike-fc100","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Ice_Strike_625711.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ice Strike</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Ice Strike\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Strike_625711.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori frigo</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Ice Damage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">45</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Freezing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Shoots an ice missile at the selected target up to 3 square meters away. If no target is selected, the damage is focused on the single square right in front of the caster.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Even though ice spells are clearly the resort of druids, this spell can be learnt by both magically gifted vocations. If a sorcerer or druid casts an Ice Strike, a freezing arrow hits any aimed opponent in a close range. Especially creatures with a sensitivity to ice, so to speak all fire dominated beings, will be wounded badly by this reliable spell which can already be learnt by rather young magicians. As the damage caused by this spell is determined by the caster's magical abilities, this spell can be a deadly weapon in the hands of an experienced magician.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice Strike animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"128\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Strike_animation_9b5a30.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>This spell used to be available only for players with active Premium Time. This was changed on October 08, 2024 and it is also available to Free Account players since then.</li>\n<li>The level requirement was reduced from level 15 to level 8 on October 21, 2025.</li>\n<li>It used to have a different animation:</li></ul>\n<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice strike1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"128\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_strike1_345774.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span></center>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Attack_Spells\">Attack Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Annihilation</li><li>Apprentice's Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a></li><li>Brutal Strike</li><li>Buzz</li><li>Chained Penance</li><li>Chill Out</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a></li><li>Death Echo</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a></li><li>Devastating Knockout</li><li>Divine Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a></li><li>Divine Grenade</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a></li><li>Double Jab</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Electrify\">Electrify</a></li><li>Energy Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Winter\">Eternal Winter</a></li><li>Ethereal Barrage</li><li>Ethereal Spear</li><li>Executioner's Throw</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a></li><li>Fire Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a></li><li>Flurry of Blows</li><li>Forceful Uppercut</li><li>Forked Glacier</li><li>Forked Thorns</li><li>Front Sweep</li><li>Great Death Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fire%20Wave\">Great Fire Wave</a></li><li>Greater Flurry of Blows</li><li>Greater Tiger Clash</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Groundshaker\">Groundshaker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hell%27s%20Core\">Hell's Core</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Flash\">Holy Flash</a></li><li>Ice Burst</li><li>Ice Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ignite\">Ignite</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inflict%20Wound\">Inflict Wound</a></li><li>Lesser Ethereal Spear</li><li>Lesser Front Sweep</li><li>Lesser Mystic Repulse</li><li>Lightning</li><li>Mud Attack</li><li>Mystic Repulse</li><li>Physical Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a></li><li>Scorch</li><li>Shield Bash</li><li>Shield Slam</li><li>Spiritual Outburst</li><li>Strong Energy Strike</li><li>Strong Ethereal Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Flame%20Strike\">Strong Flame Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Strike\">Strong Ice Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Wave\">Strong Ice Wave</a></li><li>Strong Terra Strike</li><li>Sweeping Takedown</li><li>Swift Jab</li><li>Terra Burst</li><li>Terra Strike</li><li>Terra Wave</li><li>Thousand Fist Blows</li><li>Tiger Clash</li><li>Ultimate Energy Strike</li><li>Ultimate Flame Strike</li><li>Ultimate Ice Strike</li><li>Ultimate Terra Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whirlwind%20Throw\">Whirlwind Throw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wrath%20of%20Nature\">Wrath of Nature</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"